provenance: the live arm's leaf is a spliced input: true
provenance: the read after the taken guard sees the write: true
provenance: executed values are the selected arm's: true
provenance: the deferred reading agrees with the materialized one: true
gate: routine A defers v: true
gate: the stored template no longer reads behind the shut gate: true
gate: the gated leaf is not an input of routine B: true
gate: executed values are the live operand's: true
gate: the deferred reading agrees with the materialized one: true
